; FXRE_Hybrid_EA Moderate — RiskPerTradePct=0.5, Min_RR=1.2, EA defaults (ScalpMode ON, filter OFF)
; Scope: XAU/XAG + EURUSD+ only, US30 out of scope. Sessions in PH (UTC+8), EA defaults:
; London 15-00 PH (= 07-16 UTC) / NY 20-05 PH (covers 16-21 UTC)
